# ============================================================
# Notes
# ============================================================

# .gitignore usage:
# Lines starting with '#' are comments
# Trailing spaces are ignored unless they are quoted with backslash ("\ ")
# An optional prefix "!" negates the pattern; any matching file excluded by a
#   previous pattern will become included again. Put a backslash ("\")
#   in front of the first "!" for patterns that begin with literal "!", for example,
#   "\!important!.txt".
# If there is a separator at the beginning or the end of the pattern, then the
#   pattern is relative to the directory level of the particular .gitignore file
#   itself. Otherwise the pattern may also match at any level below the .gitignore level.
